# Week-by-week nflverse stats: ~70MB of CSV that fetch_nflverse_weekly.py
# reproduces from a versioned GitHub release. The season files ARE tracked --
# they are 10x smaller and underpin final_ranks. Note the tradeoff: if nflverse
# revises a release, a future re-fetch may not reproduce today's numbers exactly.
rawdata/nflverse/stats_player_week_*.csv

